,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4868","id":954046526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCCum18443Zg-","user":{"login":"RorzGonzalez","id":81010708,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDEwNzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81010708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez","html_url":"https://github.com/RorzGonzalez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-28T17:20:15Z","updated_at":"2021-10-28T17:20:15Z","body":"Apologies, I don't honestly know how to quantify repo sizes. I infer from your comment that a laravel project would be considered a large repo.\r\n\r\nProp with default null value - no errors\r\n```js\r\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\n// No errors from this file - props are nullable as expected\r\nimport { PropType } from 'vue'\r\n\r\ninterface Item {\r\n    [key: string]: unknown\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst props = defineProps({\r\n    status: {\r\n        type: String as PropType<string | Item | null>,\r\n        required: false,\r\n        default: null\r\n    }\r\n})\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n\r\nProp with default null value - throws errors during watch\r\n```js\r\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\n\r\ninterface Item {\r\n    [key: string]: unknown\r\n}\r\ninterface Props {\r\n    status?: string | Item | null\r\n}\r\nconst props = withDefaults(defineProps<Props>(), {\r\n    status: null\r\n})\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe error for the nullable prop in script setup\r\n```sh\r\nTS2769: No overload matches this call.\r\n  The last overload gave the following error.\r\n    Type '{ type: (StringConstructor | ObjectConstructor | null)[]; required: false; default: null; }' is not assignable to type 'Prop<unknown, unknown> | null'.\r\n      Types of property 'type' are incompatible.\r\n        Type '(StringConstructor | ObjectConstructor | null)[]' is not assignable to type 'true | PropType<unknown> | null | undefined'.\r\n          Type '(StringConstructor | ObjectConstructor | null)[]' is not assignable to type 'PropConstructor<unknown>[]'.\r\n            Type 'StringConstructor | ObjectConstructor | null' is not assignable to type 'PropConstructor<unknown>'.\r\n              Type 'null' is not assignable to type 'PropConstructor<unknown>'.\r\n              ```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/954046526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"RorzGonzalez","id":81010708,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDEwNzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81010708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez","html_url":"https://github.com/RorzGonzalez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RorzGonzalez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rorz